---
/**
 * @fileoverview Legacy `/admin/budget/grid` — superseded by the Budget Command
 * Center's Grid tab.
 *
 * The 0035 island (`<BudgetGridApp />`) read the old wrapped
 * `{ grid: { months[].period, phases[].lines[].plan[]/.actual[] } }` shape from
 * `GET /api/budget/grid`. That route now returns the Command Center contract
 * (docs/plans/budget-command-center/API-CONTRACT.md §2), and the two shapes
 * cannot coexist on one endpoint. The island file is left in place pending its
 * removal; this path redirects so no one lands on a page that can no longer
 * parse its own data.
 */
return Astro.redirect("/admin/budget?tab=grid", 302);
